    <node id="&quot;1934&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1934 is the year John Hartley Williams obtained his Ph.D. from the University of California, Berkeley and also the year he demonstrated exceptional skills as a basketball player at the University of Minnesota."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0140-7c917f2b27a5</data>
    </node>
